@startuml
title androrm-detekt-rules Rule状態図
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #455A64

[*] --> Initialized
Initialized --> FileVisiting : visitKtFile
FileVisiting --> ChainAnalyzing : Select chain検出
ChainAnalyzing --> Valid : 参照Entity適正
ChainAnalyzing --> Violation : 不正参照
FileVisiting --> SourceSetScanning : duplicate table rule
SourceSetScanning --> Valid : 重複なし
SourceSetScanning --> Violation : 重複あり
Violation --> Reported : report(CodeSmell)
Valid --> Completed
Reported --> Completed
Completed --> FileVisiting : 次ファイル
Completed --> [*] : Detekt終了

@enduml
